until 3000 "falura llervu"->GetDistance player < 600
steer 77530 84207 774
steer 76739 83931 776
steer 76766 83714 776
until 3000 "falura llervu"->GetDistance player < 500
activate 05AB7B01
until 600 GetPCCell "Zainab Camp, Ashkhan's Yurt" == 1
until 900 GetJournalIndex B3_ZainabBride == 47
until 600 MenuMode == 1
bye
talk kaushad
ask Telvanni bride
expect GetJournalIndex B3_ZainabBride == 50
expect player->GetItemCount Thong == 1
bye
talk falura llervu
ask my bridegroom
expect GetJournalIndex B3_ZainabBride == 55
bye
talk kaushad
ask Telvanni bride
expect GetJournalIndex B3_ZainabBride == 60
bye
